<main class="shell prose-page support-page">
	<p class="eyebrow">Help and complaints</p><h1>Tell us what went wrong.</h1><p class="lede">Open the Kredit account where the problem happened. This helps us find the right sale or payment without asking you to share private details in public.</p>
	<section class="steps-grid" aria-label="How to get help"><article><span>01</span><h2>Open your account</h2><p>Choose the customer or seller account below.</p></article><article><span>02</span><h2>Tell us what happened</h2><p>Add the Kredit number, date, amount and the result you expected.</p></article><article><span>03</span><h2>Check for updates</h2><p>Your information and our answer will stay with the same case.</p></article></section>
	<section class="do-not card"><div><h2>You can share</h2><ul><li>The Kredit number</li><li>Dates and money amounts</li><li>A clear account of what happened</li><li>A receipt or photo that helps</li></ul></div><div><h2>Never share</h2><ul><li>Your password, OTP or recovery code</li><li>Your full card or bank login details</li><li>Another customer's private information</li></ul></div></section>
	<section class="routes"><h2>Where do you use Kredit?</h2><div><a class="primary-button" href="/buyer">I buy goods</a><a class="secondary" href="/app/settings">I sell goods</a><a class="secondary" href="/recover">I cannot sign in</a></div><p>For a possible security problem, share only a short description first. We will give you a safe way to send more details.</p></section>
</main>
<style>.support-page{max-width:72rem}.steps-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:1rem;margin:3rem 0}.steps-grid article{padding:1.25rem;border:1px solid var(--color-border);border-radius:var(--radius-lg);background:var(--color-surface)}.steps-grid span{color:var(--color-primary);font-weight:850}.steps-grid h2,.do-not h2{font-size:1.2rem}.steps-grid p,.routes p{color:var(--color-muted);line-height:1.65}.do-not{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:2rem;padding:2rem}.do-not li{margin:.55rem 0;color:var(--color-muted)}.routes{margin-top:4rem}.routes>div{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.7rem;margin:1.5rem 0}.secondary{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;padding:.7rem 1rem;border:1px solid var(--color-border);border-radius:999px;color:var(--color-foreground);font-weight:750;text-decoration:none;background:var(--color-surface)}@media(max-width:720px){.steps-grid,.do-not{grid-template-columns:1fr}}</style>
